l\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Store\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Store</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1,800</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.43.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Date Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">01/11/2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Material Laser</b> is a logic component that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> for $1,800. It projects a constant blue laser that extends about 40 studs. A material filter can be applied to the Material Laser by touching the small rectangular schematic-like piece to the left of its wire spot. If the laser hits the material its filter is set to, it will output a signal of 10.0. So long as the laser is hitting the material, it will output a continuous signal, but once the material comes out of contact with the laser, the signal will break off.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163416\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 83/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 106/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   22.937      1 Template:Logic\n100.00%   22.937      1 -total\n  6.05%    1.388      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2547-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163416 and revision id 19343. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Logic"],"links":[{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true}],"images":["MatLaserUnboxed.png","MatLaserBoxed.png"]}
